        <item>
            <title>Version 1.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 17:21:11 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <style>
                    body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
                    h3 { margin: 14px 0 6px 0; font-size: 15px; }
                    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 4px 0; }
                    li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
                </style>
                <h3>Fixed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Popover: fixed gap below menu bar by using zero-height rect anchor</li>
                    <li>Thread safety: import callback and debounce Task now run on @MainActor</li>
                    <li>Validation: added qty &gt; 0 and price &gt; 0 checks on all holding forms</li>
                    <li>ISIN: tightened heuristic to exactly 12 characters</li>
                    <li>Removed all debug print() statements</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Changed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Portfolio tab: standardized font sizes to match watchlist tab</li>
                    <li>Exchange rates: added bounds checks on pair parsing</li>
                    <li>Performance: DateFormatter is now a static let (avoids re-allocation per render)</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
