        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 May 2026 12:28:19 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <style>
                    body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
                    h3 { margin: 14px 0 6px 0; font-size: 15px; }
                    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 4px 0; }
                    li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
                </style>
                <h3>Fixed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Sparkle: Check for Updates button now works correctly</li>
                    <li>Memory: reduced footprint by disabling URLSession cache on StockService and WebSocketService</li>
                    <li>Popover: contentViewController created on open and released on close, preventing memory leaks</li>
                    <li>Event monitor: fixed cleanup for transient popover auto-close path</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Changed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>App icon updated from SB to SD branding</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2026 15:26:42 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <style>
                    body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
