                    li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
                </style>
                <h3>New</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Real-time stock prices via Yahoo Finance WebSocket</li>
                    <li>Multiple portfolios with P&amp;L tracking in your preferred currency</li>
                    <li>Watchlist with daily performance sorting</li>
                    <li>Currency conversion with historical exchange rates for accurate cost basis</li>
                    <li>Extended hours support (pre-market &amp; after-hours prices)</li>
                    <li>8 customizable menu bar display modes (P&amp;L, Total Value, Best/Worst Stock, Ticker, Icon Only)</li>
                    <li>Sparkle auto-update built in</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
